279
00:15:05,180 --> 00:15:06,217
That can't be true!

280
00:15:06,300 --> 00:15:07,130
You're wrong!

281
00:15:07,213 --> 00:15:09,197
How do you think you wound
up with a body that enormous?

282
00:15:09,280 --> 00:15:11,357
I've heard rumors about experiments that

283
