have been going on for
hundreds of years now.

284
00:15:13,400 --> 00:15:16,694
People all around the world
attempting to create giants.

285
00:15:17,080 --> 00:15:20,217
I say attempting because nobody
has ever succeeded before.

286
00:15:20,300 --> 00:15:21,947
The experiments always fail.

287
00:15:22,780 --> 00:15:26,133
I'm sorry, but there's something
that I have to tell you.

288
00:15:29,000 --> 00:15:33,120
Caesar's experiment is doomed too.

289
00:15:35,140 --> 00:15:37,081
He knows that it's going to fail.

290
00:15:37,500 --> 00:15:41,147
My guess is he's just collecting
data for his next experiment.

291
00:15:44,180 --> 00:15:46,540
So, what's going to happen to us?

292
00:15:51,900 --> 00:15:52,730
Death.

293
00:15:53,620 --> 00:15:55,973
None of you will live to see home again.

294
00:15:56,560 --> 00:15:59,580
