301
00:16:23,880 --> 00:16:25,597
That's why you're calm now.

302
00:16:25,680 --> 00:16:29,900
But there are side effects from the
candy and the experiment itself.

303
00:16:30,660 --> 00:16:32,320
Before you reach adulthood,

304
00:16:33,740 --> 00:16:35,360
