305
00:16:42,680 --> 00:16:44,500
We won't ever be grown-ups?

306
00:16:44,880 --> 00:16:46,140
That can't be right.

307
00:16:46,620 --> 00:16:49,326
What about our homes,
our mommies and daddies?

308
00:16:49,680 --> 00:16:51,445
Will we get to see them again?

309
00:16:54,100 --> 00:16:56,560
You won't, unless you leave soon.

310
00:16:56,840 --> 00:16:58,717
A lot of things have scared us here.

311
00:16:58,800 --> 00:17:01,212
We never even thought about that, though.

312
00:17:02,300 --> 00:17:06,137
When we asked you for help, it was
because we wanted to go home again.

313
00:17:06,220 --> 00:17:08,977
We wanted the chance to see
our families instead of being

314
00:17:09,060 --> 00:17:12,766
