We never actually thought that we
were going to die here, though.

317
00:17:23,320 --> 00:17:26,137
We thought we were going to
leave here once we got better.

318
00:17:26,220 --> 00:17:28,632
That's what he said, and we believed him.

319
00:17:29,100 --> 00:17:31,697
Um, we ate that candy
because they gave it to us!

320
00:17:31,780 --> 00:17:33,777
We didn't know we would die from it!

321
00:17:33,860 --> 00:17:34,720
Yes, I know!

322
00:17:35,020 --> 00:17:37,196
It's not your fault, none of this is!

323
00:17:37,340 --> 00:17:41,240
That's why we're gonna do whatever
it takes to defeat Caesar!

324
00:17:41,520 --> 00:17:43,060
Nothing will stop us!

325
00:17:45,700 --> 00:17:46,760
I'm sorry!

326
00:17:50,760 --> 00:17:55,120
So sorry that we didn't get here
sooner to save you from him!

327
00:17:56,180 --> 00:17:57,697
We can't die!

328
00:17:57,780 --> 00:17:59,100
Please stop her.

329
00:17:59,400 --> 00:18:01,380
I don't want to die here.

330
00:18:02,140 --> 00:18:03,420
Then it won't happen.

331
00:18:03,640 --> 00:18:05,346
We'll find a way to save you.

332
00:18:07,760 --> 00:18:08,701
Caesar's strong.

333
00:18:08,840 --> 00:18:12,857
He's powerful, devious, and maybe the
most horrible man in the entire world.

334
00:18:12,940 --> 00:18:14,705
But you should know something.

335
00:18:15,700 --> 00:18:18,620
Our captain is better
than him and stronger.

336
00:18:19,560 --> 00:18:23,317
As a matter of fact, he's going
to be king of the pirates someday.

337
00:18:23,400 --> 00:18:24,230
He can do it.

338
00:18:24,313 --> 00:18:27,300
No matter what, Luffy is
going to take Caesar down.

339
00:18:33,680 --> 00:18:35,437
So please listen carefully.

340
00:18:35,520 --> 00:18:37,337
I think I have a plan.

341
00:18:37,420 --> 00:18:40,677
We can't let the other
children have any more candy.

342
00:18:40,760 --> 00:18:41,590
Do you understand?

343
00:18:41,673 --> 00:18:47,797
I'm going to do my best to
get them all sedated here.

344
00:18:47,880 --> 00:18:48,957
That should make them easier.

345
00:18:49,040 --> 00:18:52,077
To control but I need your help.

346
00:18:52,160 --> 00:18:56,042
Do you think you can go to the
biscuit room and guard the candies!

347
00:18:59,620 --> 00:19:00,450
Yes!

348
00:19:00,533 --> 00:19:03,857
Whatever I have to do, I'll make
sure nobody eats any more candy!

349
00:19:03,940 --> 00:19:05,881
I want us all to escape together!

350
00:19:06,460 --> 00:19:07,290
Okay.

351
00:19:12,300 --> 00:19:15,080
I think she puked blood. Why though?

352
00:19:15,180 --> 00:19:16,937
All she did was eat the candy.

353
00:19:17,020 --> 00:19:18,800
She really doesn't look good.

354
00:19:19,860 --> 00:19:21,240
I can't believe it.

355
00:19:21,340 --> 00:19:23,105
The children have stopped now.

356
00:19:25,140 --> 00:19:27,434
That's what happens when you're greedy.

357
